  "limitations": [
    "Whitelist/code-path audit, not an adversarial security sandbox. Allowed nested receipt pose fields are trusted from the actual producer, not recursively schema-sanitized.",
    "Independent simulator safety/scoring uses private object state and can return symbolic stop/terminal labels. No raw pose/depth oracle was found; this is not a claim of unmonitored vision-only sensing.",
    "Private diagnostics, truth trajectories and teacher observations still exist on local disk outside the provider input path; local code users can access them.",
    "A1/F6 selection, nominal10x10x67.5mm dimensions, far-hinge role and nominal27mm depth are task priors, not current truth measurements.",
